    "document_title": "银行间债券市场非金融企业债务融资工具信息披露规则（2023修订）",
    "source_version": "2023",
    "official_url": "https://www.nafmii.org.cn/zlgl/zlgz/hxgll/202312/P020231201504225239165.pdf",
